    "systemRequirementsSection": "<ul>\n<li>Your organization must be enrolled in the Microsoft Frontier program.</li>\n<li>An admin must opt in to Microsoft Scout (Frontier) and accept the applicable terms and conditions.</li>\n<li>You must be included in the Microsoft Frontier program access group for Microsoft Scout (Frontier).</li>\n<li>Intune must be enabled for the relevant managed devices.</li>\n<li>You must have permission to install desktop applications, unless the app is deployed by your admin.</li>\n<li>You must have an active GitHub Copilot Business or GitHub Copilot Enterprise subscription.</li>\n</ul>",
