    "installInstructionSection": "<ol>\n<li>On this page, click Download, then select the Microsoft Scout (Frontier) installer for your operating system.</li>\n<li>To save the download on your computer so that you can install it later, click Save.</li>\n<li>Run the installer and follow the setup prompts.</li>\n<li>Launch the Microsoft Scout (Frontier) application</li>\n<li>Sign in with your Microsoft 365 work or school account</li>\n<li>Sign in with your GitHub Copilot account</li>\n<li>If you face issues, contact your system administrator to ensure all system requirements have been met</li>\n</ol>",
